Of course I knew her. Every player here in Athens has been on a campaign with the great Tillius.

AGNES
So you can help me figure out what it all means?

CHUCK
Figure it out? Wait. What do you want to do with this exactly?

AGNES
Well, Chuck. It's a game, right? I want to play it.

